# Round 83 — Yang–Mills lane: what was added, what is still open

Plain-language record of one working round on the Clay Yang–Mills lane.
Parent index: [the frozen research count](YangMillsClayFourFrozenResearchLemmas.md).
Diagram: [round83-architecture.puml](round83-architecture.puml).

## Short version

Two new machine-checked Agda modules were added. Neither closes an open
research leaf. One supplies the missing *proof* that the estimation machinery
for the literal one-loop diagram syntax is sound; the other replaces a strong
premise about the renormalisation-group (RG) step with a strictly weaker one.

Nothing was renamed, no count was decremented, and no new assumption was
introduced anywhere.

